{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Ahh... adventurer. The repair work on the Well of Voyage has been completed. We're finally ready to move against my brother.","uri":"6af8f55515a33128040684f1242450f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"And to you adventurer. Have you found a way through the Underground Pass yet?","uri":"60eaf21f21579fd3042895f0db884fb7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"And to you adventurer. I assume you're here about King Tyras?","uri":"a74f0c75faa5b8796a889c9fd0bd83e3.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"As a result, I had a wall built around West Ardougne to act as a barrier between him and the rest of the world. Tyras is king of West Ardougne, sealing off the city was the only way to stop him and the Dark Lord.","uri":"f1abc2521cd6dbecdd7bec5caa1962f9.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"As you wish. Return to me when you are ready and we will begin.","uri":"f757952c66c2ae08f0f0c103645d1a35.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Fair enough. Return to me when you are ready and we will discuss our next steps.","uri":"a5f316f5d5532007fdcaa0e8c71eea12.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Farewell adventurer. Return to me once you are ready to begin.","uri":"b6e1366b1097b844093cdce098d45656.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"For now, I thank you for your help adventurer. Your loyalty is an inspiration to all.","uri":"1031d6da367a68de711757b36b117bcd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"I do indeed. I recently managed to make contact with the elves that inhabit the western lands.","uri":"6462b734b4a4b00a723b08debea2e32a.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"I knew people would never believe the truth, so I had the plague made up as an excuse for the cordon. I'm not proud of it, but it was the only way to keep people safe.","uri":"d1b0d3e91be9fceade53575eb9ca07ab.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"I see. I will send our best mages in at once. Once they have made the repairs, we will finally be ready to stop King Tyras.","uri":"1ec8aeea0e250e73d61cf8c7461fe93e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"If my brother is to be stopped, a way through the Underground Pass must be found. This is the task I have for you. Do you think you're up for it?","uri":"0c81cd090916c532c73e1fb6c67d34e6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Incredible, you are a true warrior. So do we now have a way through to the west?","uri":"580dbe836c56e1c5da4c1119c5039bd6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Indeed we are. My brother has been gathering strength in the west, preparing to move against us. But now that we have a way through, we can move against him first.","uri":"8db4e1575e587fc51ef4154352de3ed5.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"It shouldn't take the mages long at all. Once their work is done we will finally be ready to move against my brother.","uri":"edd287e28c4c863108d57742fbe4f9f6.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"My brother, King Tyras, was always a bit of an explorer. He went on numerous expeditions to the lands west of here. On one of these expeditions, he was captured by the forces of the Dark Lord.","uri":"0a3a30810a19f8dd87ebad71ca63ac3f.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Once you are through, you will be met by some representatives of Lord Iorwerth.","uri":"a35eb1a70d36d1d47fb65565032aaff8.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Remember, the Underground Pass is lethal. Go prepared with food and armour or you won't last long.","uri":"ba72b5603367bc64cfe873fce6bfeb57.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"The adventurer returns, any news?","uri":"191266d5febacfdb6d5646bd44621fdf.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"The Dark Lord agreed to spare his life, but only on one condition... That he would drink from the Chalice of Eternity. The chalice corrupted him. He joined forces with the Dark Lord, the embodiment of pure evil...","uri":"cbb06c3ce1fdd5e1de714fbf24d7a25c.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"To make matters worse, some crazed group of cultists has recently made their home in the pass. Their leader, some madman named Iban, claims to be the son of Zamorak himself.","uri":"04dfec20669523ed71ea3387276a4407.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Together, you are to find a way through the pass. Once you have done so, return to me.","uri":"eb157f97b6df55ec8c9217cabf7471cc.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Unfortunately, the pass is a treacherous place. Some of my best soldiers have fallen trying to find a way though.","uri":"5031a13ab119299a975920590303fadd.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Very well. Return to me when you are ready.","uri":"1088c9a2aceba97f74274dd97792baca.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Well keep at it. Come to me when you have something to report.","uri":"78014422671bd33c7d988ff44982c16e.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Well that may well change soon. Apparently, my brother has been causing them quite a bit of trouble. As such, they've agreed to help us get rid of him once and for all.","uri":"24e4d08a5ce1ffc6a7eb51ebe1596069.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"Well, as we've previously discussed, my brother is currently gathering strength in the lands west of here. The only known way into those lands is through the Underground Pass.","uri":"8382c55557a121d2baf35ac6eaa41ebe.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"With their help, you are to find my brother and kill him. Once that's done, return to me.","uri":"4248d9af5744aa6b2ddacc60257387b0.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"You are to head into the Underground Pass and through the Well of Voyage. The mages should have it repaired by the time you arrive.","uri":"17824dab25a3853db6db80400c6337cb.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"King Lathas","text":"You'll find the entrance to the Underground Pass at the far end of West Ardougne. My main tracker, Koftik, will meet you there.","uri":"0018632b1c43800bab7a3d690b357f18.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"Blood... Pain... Hate...","uri":"9181448860a99196e89be86ee3b58a57.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"Death is only the beginning...","uri":"ff18801dc423dbc243a8c6cad51d13a7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"Give in to your desires...","uri":"d76be4a17e5f931f4398b248344f95d7.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"Hear me...","uri":"9431775445e4fa4b58c7ffb274639754.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"I can set you free...","uri":"520c32ad1981c8e5af2c355d074a31ba.mp3"}
{"quest":"Underground Pass","character":"Mysterious Voice","text":"I will release you...","uri":"8e438bc05e3bd909fc9120a99eb5ca74.mp3"}
